## Features

- [Omni-Channel Chat](https://www.salesmartly.com/features/omni-channel-chat/): Supports multi-channel coverage and access such as WhatsApp, Messenger, Instagram, Telegram, LINE, Email, VKontakte, WeChat, Zalo and Youtube.
- [Automation & Chatbots](https://www.salesmartly.com/features/automatization/): The AI intelligent online customer service system supports access to mainstream social media channels such as WhatsApp, Facebook, Instagram, and telegram, automatically replies to frequently asked questions, and responds quickly to customer inquiries.
- [Collaboration](https://www.salesmartly.com/features/collaboration/): The cross-border team online chat system helps companies develop multiple channels for cross-border business and participate in the global market. Suitable for: cross-border e-commerce, independent website sellers, market personnel, and customer service teams.
- [Customer Relationship Management](https://www.salesmartly.com/features/customer-relationship-management/): Customers can communicate with customer service through website online customer service, multiple channels, etc. In the CRM system, all communication records can be displayed intuitively, and each record can be browsed and tracked.
- [Data Analysis](https://www.salesmartly.com/features/data-analysis/): An AI intelligent chat tool suitable for mainstream social media analysis, helping companies collect and analyze product-related data on social media platforms, such as the number of fans, comments, shares, likes, etc.
- [Real-Time Translations](https://www.salesmartly.com/features/real-time-translations/): Provide a one-stop intelligent customer service solution with real-time automatic translation in 134 languages, allowing you to communicate with customers fluently and avoid affecting customer experience due to language barriers.
- [Omnichannel CRM & Customer Service](https://www.salesmartly.com/features/crm/): Online customer service systems can centrally integrate customer messages from multiple channels such as online chat (Livechat), WhatsApp, Facebook Messenger, TikTok, Instagram, Telegram, LINE, Email, VKontakte, and WeChat into a single platform. This supports unified management, real-time translation, intelligent assisted replies, and human customer service assistance. User information can be manually tagged and annotated to create a complete customer profile.
- [AI Agents](https://www.salesmartly.com/features/ai-agents/): Build high-performance AI Agents capable of independent thinking and task execution. Whether for pre-sales acquisition, after-sales support, or complex business processes, AI handles it precisely.
- [Precision Bulk Messaging](https://www.salesmartly.com/features/broadcast-messages/): The precise mass messaging function allows you to send mass messages to customers on multiple channels such as WhatsApp, Messenger, Instagram, and TikTok with one click. It supports personalized templates and automatic variable replacement, enabling precise targeting based on customer tags, sources, and behaviors. Combined with automated triggering rules and intelligent scheduling, it allows businesses to send the right content at the best time, improving customer interaction rates, conversion rates, and marketing efficiency.
- [Traffic Splitting Links & Dynamic QR Codes](https://www.salesmartly.com/features/diversion-link/): Create multi-channel referral links and dynamic QR codes to drive customers to different channels or customer service with a single click, achieving precise traffic allocation and efficient conversion. Supports traffic splitting based on channel, time period, and region, and allows real-time tracking of click and conversion data.

